From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 13:40:33 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] newdev: DiInstallDriverA/W (3245)

Stages the INF in the driver store (SetupCopyOEMInf) and installs it on the
present devices it supports unless the device already has a better driver
(rank of the matched ID, then date, then version; DIIRFLAG_FORCE_INF installs
anyway); DIIRFLAG_INSTALL_AS_SET stages every INF of a directory. Documented
errors: ERROR_FILE_NOT_FOUND, ERROR_INVALID_FLAGS, ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED
(not an administrator), ERROR_IN_WOW64 (32-bit caller). NeedReboot is set from
the devices' DI_NEEDREBOOT. Needs 3244.

